<section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="badge">O&G Data Architecture & Machine Learning</div>
        <h1>Lower OPEX.<br/>Optimize Assets.<br/><span class="highlight">Unlock Your Data.</span></h1>
        
        <p>WellData Partners bridges the gap between legacy field operations and modern cloud architecture. We help Upstream and Midstream operators turn raw sensor and production data into predictive, actionable intelligence.</p>
        
        <div class="cta-group">
            <a href="mailto:contact@welldatapartners.com" class="btn-primary">Schedule a Consultation</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .hero {
        padding: 8rem 2rem;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        align-items: center;
        min-height: 90vh;
        text-align: center;
    }
    .container {
        max-width: 800px;
    }
    .badge {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
        background-color: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.1);
        color: #60A5FA;
        border-radius: 9999px;
        font-size: 0.875rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    }
    h1 {
        font-size: 4rem;
        line-height: 1.1;
        margin: 0 0 1.5rem 0;
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }
    .highlight {
        color: #3B82F6;
    }
    p {
        font-size: 1.25rem;
        color: var(--text-muted);
        margin-bottom: 3rem;
        max-width: 650px;
        margin-left: auto;
        margin-right: auto;
    }
    .btn-primary {
        background-color: var(--accent);
        color: white;
        padding: 1rem 2.5rem;
        border-radius: 0.5rem;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        transition: background-color 0.3s;
    }
    .btn-primary:hover {
        background-color: var(--accent-hover);
    }
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
        h1 { font-size: 2.5rem; }
    }
</style>